00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.270
And using some of
those policies,

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.270
you can do those four steps
we just spoke about, right?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:13.830
Token, get your credentials,
finally access the service.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:17.190
Or you can use some of the
out-of-the-box coding policies

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:17.820
that we have.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.790
And we support different
kinds of languages--

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:25.080
