00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:04.330
So in this case, I have
deployed this thing for test.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.330
And really, the interface
mechanism is super simple.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.400
In this case, you take
the service account

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:13.870
that you have from within the
Google Cloud Platform project,

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:15.370
