securely and give you a checksum

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:25.990
out here, right?

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:29.940
So separation of concerns from a
governance perspective, the org

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:33.635
or the extension admin
can come and do this, OK?

00:15:33.635 --> 00:15:36.597
And out here, you
will see logs as

00:15:36.597 --> 00:15:38.680
to when that's specific
extension is communicating

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.870
