00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:38.330
So in this case, we have three
actions defined out here,

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.350
which are obviously reflective
of what the Data Loss

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:45.890
Prevention API exhibits,
which is deidentifyWithMask,

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.410
WithType, or redact the image.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:52.220
So I just happen to use
the deidentifyWithMask.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.800
And you can see I've already
configured this out here.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:59.020
I'm sorry. deidentifyWithType,
specify the action out here,

00:16:59.020 --> 00:16:59.680
and that's it.

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:04.099
At this point in
time, let's go take

00:17:04.099 --> 00:17:05.630
this thing for a quick test.

00:17:09.779 --> 00:17:11.780
So I'm using Postman out here.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:23.099
And I've made some
changes in my API proxy

00:17:23.099 --> 00:17:29.110
