00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:40.000
So in this case, here
is the simple request,

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.140
which is going in.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:42.880
Let's hit Send.

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.210
And when I do that,
